  <p id="c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0000" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_A">沈勁</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0004" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_A">世堅</persName>，吳興武康人也。父<persName id="c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0015" ref="4c2_19b_bf4">充</persName>，與<persName id="c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0018" ref="39o_b6y_n74">王敦</persName>構逆，眾敗而逃，為部曲將<persName id="c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0032" ref="fxt_25c_3fh">吳儒</persName>所殺。</p>
